sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(224,242,241) Process Engine, any replica
    participant S as Scheduler thread
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant W as pre_engine_watermark
    participant H as pre_history, current partition
    participant N as pre_node_stats_hourly
  end
  Note over S: every stats.rollup-interval (5 min), window end = now() - 5 min safety lag
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over S,N: One short transaction, database work only, no network call
    S->>W: SELECT watermark FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED WHERE job 'node-stats'
    alt another replica holds the row
      W-->>S: no row, skip this run
    else row locked by this replica
      S->>H: aggregate NODE_COMPLETED, NODE_FAILED, INCIDENT_RAISED, SLA_BREACHED where occurred_at in (watermark, window end], BRIN range scan
      H-->>S: per tenant, definition, node, hour: counts and duration histogram
      S->>N: INSERT ON CONFLICT add counts, add histogram buckets
      S->>W: UPDATE watermark = window end
      S->>W: COMMIT, statement_timeout 10 s
    end
  end
  alt statement timeout or error
    S->>W: ROLLBACK, watermark unchanged, next run repeats the slice
  end
  Note over S,N: Step transactions never update counters, so no hot row lock on the write path
